From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:49:58 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] "remove avagrahas" overrides "avagrahas to short a"; Settings
 warns of the conflict

Saktumiva applies the ticked normalizations in list order, so with both ticked
"avagrahas to short a" turned every avagraha into a before "remove avagrahas"
ran: anye 'tra / anye tra were compared as anye atra / anye tra and reported
as a variant. Now "remove avagrahas" wins over "avagrahas to short a" and
"double avagrahas", and the settings screen says so as soon as both are ticked.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
